        of the log before anything leaves your machine. Paths and personal details are stripped first, and your email
        address is included only if you add it. If you've found a security problem, email the same address and please
        give us a chance to ship a fix before you publish.
    </p>
    <p>
        Here's how we work: data-loss reports go to the front of the queue, and when we find a bug we ship the fix to
        everyone through Cmdr's built-in updater (on by default, downloaded in the background, applied when you
        restart). We're describing our practice, not offering a separate warranty on top of the rights you already have
        by law, and it isn't a promise you can make a claim on.
    </p>

    <h2>5. AI features</h2>
    <p>Cmdr includes AI-powered features (such as natural language file renaming and search). Please be aware:</p>
